repository-code: "https://github.com/afelin/vibe-engine-os"
url: "https://github.com/afelin/vibe-engine-os"
abstract: >-
  Free open-source promotion-gate primitives for AI-assisted software change:
  TaskBond, mandates, zero-token gates, depth dial, forever loop, tamper-evident
  capsules and HPURL proof links, deterministic replay, adversarial gauntlet,
  MCP rulebook tools, light heal/Pearl operators, and Assisted-by attribution.
  Regulation-agnostic; posture packs are house-rule overlays, not law.
  CyberReady remains Planned when not installed (fail-open).
keywords:
